@inject RiotClient RiotClient
@page "/"
@using YetAnotherLeagueStatTracker.Services

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="home">
    <h1>Yet Another League Stat Tracker</h1>
    <p>YALST is a work in progress tool. Basic functions such as viewing recent 
        match history, including aggregating profiles, may function but without 
        additional information.</p>
    <p>Don't play League of Legends? View an example account!:</p>
    
    <ul>
        <li>
            <a href="/profile/lilith">Lilith (Aggregate)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="/profile/Ratirl">Ratirl (Aggregate)</a>
        </li>
            
        <li>
            <a href="/profile/euw1/Lilith-Nyaa">Lilith#nyaa (Single)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="/profile/euw1/Αrt%20The%20Clοwn-EUW">Αrt The Clοwn#EUW (Single)</a>
        </li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>YALST is a WIP tool designed to fix my frustrations with other off the shelf tools. These tools often neglect 
        that many users utilise multiple accounts whilst playing, leading to difficulties when trying to view a complete 
        match history of an individual. This website aims to provide a tool that prioritises split profiles, whilst 
        fixing other minor annoyances  (e.g. Kayn's transformation not being reflected in match histories)</p>
    <p>For technical details, visit <a href="https://kitten.rs/projects/YALST">Kitten.rs</a></p>
</div>

